# Formspree form ID — the part after /f/ in your endpoint URL.
# https://formspree.io → your form → the endpoint looks like
#   https://formspree.io/f/xyzabcde
# so the value here is: xyzabcde
#
# Set this in Vercel under Settings → Environment Variables (all environments).
# Without it, the contact form shows the "email us directly" fallback instead
# of silently pretending to send.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
